## CQ-RPB-01
@group copy of the smallest save (or `--world`), scenes in the End void
@commands `python3 tools/perf/rpack/rp_bench.py setup $G`; `setsid nohup python3 tools/perf/rpack/rp_bench.py drive $G perf/reports/rpbench-1 > perf/reports/rpbench-1.out 2>&1 &`; follow `perf/reports/rpbench-1/timeline.txt`
@pass `[rpbench] start` with `"sodium":true`; `site` `nonAirSamples` 0; 23 `reload` lines, each followed by its `scene` lines; `done` with `failed` 0; no `error` lines in `$G/logs/kubejs/client.log`
@fails No `start`: the click path missed (window not 854x480) or `global.rpbenchPlan` missing; `error` with a Rhino message: the call in `rp_bench.js` named there (overload ambiguity, see memory `rhino-fieldandmethods-gotcha`); site not void: move `SITE` in `rp_bench.py`
@draft no batch holds this row yet
## CQ-RPB-02
@group results of RPB-01
@commands `python3 tools/perf/rpack/rp_report.py perf/reports/rpbench-1`
@pass Control drift under 3%; `all` reload sd under 10% of its mean; block atlas of `all` 8192x4096 (as in the user's latest.log); every target has a reload delta
@fails Large drift: rerun with `--repeat 2`; no atlas column: latest.log lacks `Created:` lines in the reload window (check the wall-clock fields)
@draft no batch holds this row yet
## CQ-RPB-03
